1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 28]</font>

15
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

16
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Word has come from Yunshan Town.</font>

17
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The lady is already on her way back.</font>

18
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ah, these children of mine.</font>

19
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One dares to let her go;</font>

20
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the other dares to run away.</font>

21
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing I kept my wits about me.</font>

22
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

23
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">should we head straight to Yunshan Town?</font>

24
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have no choice</font>

25
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but to take them down one by one.</font>

26
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Inn]</font>

27
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin, come back with us.</font>

28
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you find me here?</font>

29
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because of me.</font>

30
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

31
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty's torture was a ruse?</font>

32
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

33
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have Ying to thank for her concern.</font>

34
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She couldn't bear
to see me suffer in prison,</font>

35
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she told me where you were staying.</font>

36
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She would never betray me.</font>

37
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

38
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you don't know her at all.</font>

39
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Ying</font>

40
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gets what she wants,</font>

41
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'll toss it away.</font>

42
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's never one to settle down.</font>

43
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you truly believe she would</font>

44
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give up her status for your sake?</font>

45
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's been pampered since childhood.</font>

46
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she possibly endure
such hardship?</font>

47
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just</font>

48
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a fleeting novelty to her.</font>

49
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin, return to Xizhao.</font>

50
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is where you belong.</font>

51
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you making a suggestion</font>

52
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or giving an order?</font>

53
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Consider it a word of caution.</font>

54
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin,</font>

55
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a man of your status in Beiyuan</font>

56
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will only invite endless trouble.</font>

57
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have a sister</font>

58
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a brother you grew up with.</font>

59
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should think of them.</font>

60
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am but a scholar.</font>

61
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know nothing of court affairs.</font>

62
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What good would going back even do?</font>

63
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you powerful men</font>

64
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">insist on hounding me like this?</font>

65
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are still far too naive.</font>

66
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you return,</font>

67
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you will come to understand.</font>

68
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the court,</font>

69
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there is no such thing as retreat.</font>

70
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin.</font>

71
00:03:59,080 --> 00:03:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After you.</font>

72
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liars.</font>

73
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of you, liars.</font>

74
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you deceive me?</font>

75
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone has been deceiving me.</font>

76
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Throw it.</font>

77
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Throw it right at me.</font>

78
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you lie to me?</font>

79
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I lied to you. That was my fault.</font>

80
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if I hadn't done it,</font>

81
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you really never coming back?</font>

82
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For that man,</font>

83
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd abandon your family</font>

84
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and even your father?</font>

85
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Father,</font>

86
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you could accept Mobai,</font>

87
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could have both the man and my family.</font>

88
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm only doing this for your own good.</font>

89
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After you left, Qin Mobai</font>

90
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">resolved to return and be the Prince.</font>

91
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He even sought out the soldiers.</font>

92
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By now,</font>

93
00:04:58,640 --> 00:04:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he should already be</font>

94
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the Xizhao diplomatic mission.</font>

95
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget about him.</font>

96
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't believe it. I won't.</font>

97
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are young and inexperienced.</font>

98
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You act rashly, led by your emotions.</font>

99
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only when you come to understand</font>

100
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will you know</font>

101
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what is truly best.</font>

102
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can grant you anything,</font>

103
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">except when it comes to your future.</font>

104
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't care!</font>

105
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only want Mobai.</font>

106
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want nothing else but him.</font>

107
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was born a man,</font>

108
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet in times of great calamity,</font>

109
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could not protect my home,</font>

110
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

111
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or Jiang Ying.</font>

112
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm powerless over my own fate.</font>

113
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the use of over a decade</font>

114
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of studying the classics?</font>

115
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hyah!</font>

116
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

117
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:56,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will we make it in time?</font>

118
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We will.</font>

119
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold tight.</font>

120
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hyah!</font>

121
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hyah!</font>

122
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hyah!</font>

123
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan of Beiyuan requests
an audience with the Fourth Prince.</font>

124
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Halt.</font>

125
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

126
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

127
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silly girl.</font>

128
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you crying?</font>

129
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not like we'll never
see each other again.</font>

130
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

131
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we agree</font>

132
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you'd wait for me to join you?</font>

133
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you suddenly change your mind</font>

134
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and go off to be a prince of Xizhao?</font>

135
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you miss me,</font>

136
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can come to Xizhao
to see me anytime.</font>

137
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did something happen</font>

138
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between you and Jiang Ying?</font>

139
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've come at the right time.</font>

140
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just about to write to you both.</font>

141
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard some things</font>

142
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the Bloodlure Poison</font>

143
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the Xizhao envoy.</font>

144
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there a suspicion?</font>

145
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The secret lies in this:</font>

146
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison</font>

147
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">requires the victim's blood</font>

148
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to serve as its catalyst.</font>

149
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think carefully.</font>

150
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then, could your whole family</font>

151
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have been ambushed through such a lapse?</font>

152
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Using blood as the catalyst...</font>

153
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was that Imperial Physician.</font>

154
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How would a mere Imperial Physician</font>

155
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dare to be so bold</font>

156
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as to poison your family?</font>

157
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That Imperial Physician</font>

158
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was brought by Duke Dingguo.</font>

159
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father wanted to confront him,</font>

160
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but Duke Dingguo stopped him.</font>

161
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They planned to act during the wedding</font>

162
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so as not to alert
the snake in the grass.</font>

163
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How loyal</font>

164
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and selfless of Duke Dingguo.</font>

165
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

166
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it truly was Duke Dingguo</font>

167
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who poisoned his family</font>

168
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and framed our family,</font>

169
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then Beiyuan is no longer safe either.</font>

170
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you are willing,</font>

171
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can journey with me to Xizhao.</font>

172
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The road ahead is unknown.</font>

173
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I will do everything in my power</font>

174
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to keep you safe.</font>

175
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is precisely why</font>

176
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must face this together with him.</font>

177
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be very careful.</font>

178
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will give you one last chance.</font>

179
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you speak or not?</font>

180
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

181
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, I truly know nothing.</font>

182
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you, please let me go.</font>

183
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness...</font>

184
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still won't talk?</font>

185
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you can die.</font>

186
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

187
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

188
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

189
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Imperial Physician is dead.</font>

190
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Killing his son</font>

191
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would be pointless.</font>

192
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It only gives ill-intentioned people
an opening.</font>

193
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ill-intentioned people?</font>

194
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would like to see</font>

195
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what they can do to me.</font>

196
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

197
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop this.</font>

198
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If something happens to you,
what becomes of me?</font>

199
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know the resentment in your heart.</font>

200
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think I don't feel the same?</font>

201
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you kill him today,</font>

202
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't that be grieving our own
while gladdening the enemy?</font>

203
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the cunning hares are dead,</font>

204
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the hunting hounds are cooked.</font>

205
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father fought battles all his life,</font>

206
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and this is how it ends for him.</font>

207
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They bribed the Imperial Physician</font>

208
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to draw blood and poison
under the guise of treatment</font>

209
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and framed my family
as spies for Xizhao.</font>

210
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, they used our wedding</font>

211
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to wipe out my family entirely.</font>

212
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such an intricate scheme.</font>

213
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every step carefully calculated.</font>

214
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo alone</font>

215
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could hardly have pulled it off unseen.</font>

216
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unless...</font>

217
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The new Emperor ascended young,</font>

218
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his footing in court unsteady.</font>

219
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My family earned a Prince's title
through battle,</font>

220
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and your father was a Governor
with military power.</font>

221
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our marriage alliance was a threat</font>

222
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the imperial family.</font>

223
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A plan to kill two birds with one stone.</font>

224
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're bound to be tempted.</font>

225
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

226
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you truly are
His Majesty's sharpest blade.</font>

227
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

228
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That poison catalyst</font>

229
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must still be in Duke Dingguo's hands.</font>

230
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must get it back.</font>

231
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I cannot let your life</font>

232
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be held in his grasp.</font>

233
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not be controlled by anyone.</font>

234
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo's birthday banquet
is coming.</font>

235
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For now, this is all just speculation.</font>

236
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the time comes,</font>

237
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will probe for his true intentions.</font>

238
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying!</font>

239
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've scoured the entire city</font>

240
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and bought all your favorite dishes.</font>

241
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finish it all.</font>

242
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let it all out.</font>

243
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, say something.</font>

244
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father already told us</font>

245
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he's gone back to Xizhao</font>

246
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be a prince.</font>

247
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop tormenting yourself.</font>

248
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I broke my promise first and left him.</font>

249
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai must be angry with me.</font>

250
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why he went
to be a prince in Xizhao.</font>

251
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xizhao is so far away.</font>

252
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's all along the journey.</font>

253
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wonder if he's eating well.</font>

254
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still thinking</font>

255
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of him?</font>

256
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, are you dense?</font>

257
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe he just wanted to ditch you</font>

258
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and go back to being a prince.</font>

259
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you something.</font>

260
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When a man faces power,</font>

261
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">such trivial romance
isn't worth mentioning.</font>

262
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't speak of Mobai that way.</font>

263
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll say it just as I please.</font>

264
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A real man should be broad-minded.</font>

265
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he's petty and narrow-hearted.</font>

266
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not only did he lure you into elopement,</font>

267
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but he also got our father punished.</font>

268
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, use your head for once.</font>

269
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you truly want our father
to rot in jail?</font>

270
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, he is Qinglan's brother.</font>

271
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But let me tell you.</font>

272
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if Qinglan stood here,</font>

273
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would still curse him.</font>

274
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You keep cursing him!</font>

275
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll keep cursing him!</font>

276
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What of it?</font>

277
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop that.</font>

278
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still cursing him?</font>

279
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop that.</font>

280
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't hit me!</font>

281
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop that.</font>

282
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You missed!</font>

283
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop cursing him.</font>

284
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It smells so good.</font>

285
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you laughing at?</font>

286
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there fire on me?</font>

287
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Check for me.</font>

288
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Duke Dingguo's Mansion]</font>

289
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

290
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As you instructed, Fuhai</font>

291
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has already died.</font>

292
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it weren't for him,</font>

293
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we would never have learned</font>

294
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Qin Mobai is a prince of Xizhao.</font>

295
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have given him</font>

296
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">due dignity.</font>

297
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The case of Princess Changle
is fully closed.</font>

298
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai has left for Xizhao.</font>

299
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then should we keep this catalyst</font>

300
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that can control Prince Duan's blood</font>

301
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to trigger the poison's relapse</font>

302
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or bring about his recovery?</font>

303
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This determines Prince Duan's fate.</font>

304
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty has given the order.</font>

305
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll use my birthday celebration</font>

306
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to make Prince Duan suffer a relapse</font>

307
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of his old illness and drop dead</font>

308
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in front of everyone.</font>

309
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Master.</font>

310
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

311
00:13:59,040 --> 00:14:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you hadn't been so stubborn,</font>

312
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">opposing Beiyuan for the Qin family,</font>

313
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how would you end up
just like your father?</font>

314
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are the girls at Drunken House?</font>

315
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you blind?</font>

316
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've dirtied my clothes.</font>

317
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you even afford to pay for this?</font>

318
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop right there.</font>

319
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

320
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you treating me as a beggar?</font>

321
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I'm an easy mark, do you?</font>

322
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You fool.</font>

323
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hit him.</font>

324
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

325
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to find
the antidote's whereabouts.</font>

326
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you come along,</font>

327
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear I will be distracted.</font>

328
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo's Mansion
is heavily guarded.</font>

329
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I happen to know it well.</font>

330
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps I could be of help.</font>

331
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

332
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am only afraid...</font>

333
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Afraid of danger.</font>

334
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is what worries me most.</font>

335
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We agreed to face things together.</font>

336
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you act alone in secret?</font>

337
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

338
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then promise me</font>

339
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you will eat well later,</font>

340
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and do not arouse anyone's suspicion.</font>

341
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

342
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

343
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Duke Dingguo's Mansion]</font>

344
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lord Censor.</font>

345
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, come in.</font>

346
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Wang.</font>

347
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right this way, please.</font>

348
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince has arrived.</font>

349
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

350
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you'd come with Prince Duan.</font>

351
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

352
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a good chat with Jiang Ying first.</font>

353
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go offer my respects to the Duke.</font>

354
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find you later.</font>

355
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

356
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk over there.</font>

357
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

358
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please have some tea.</font>

359
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some tea.</font>

360
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, bad news!</font>

361
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and see, quickly.</font>

362
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

363
00:17:56,320 --> 00:17:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a matter to attend to.</font>

364
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please wait just a moment.</font>

365
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See to our guests.</font>

366
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

367
00:18:06,390 --> 00:18:07,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

368
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

369
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:16,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

370
00:18:16,660 --> 00:18:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

371
00:18:20,650 --> 00:18:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

372
00:18:25,170 --> 00:18:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

373
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:35,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

374
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

375
00:18:42,310 --> 00:18:45,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

376
00:18:46,360 --> 00:18:50,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

377
00:18:50,910 --> 00:18:53,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

378
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:59,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

379
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:03,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
